00:06:15.842 --> 00:06:18.077 align:start size:97% position:3%
- Well, I keep thinking
it's gonna hit rock bottom,

00:06:18.077 --> 00:06:19.011
and I've been thinking that

00:06:19.011 --> 00:06:20.847
for the better part of a decade,

00:06:20.847 --> 00:06:22.482
but I think what's
happening instead

00:06:22.482 --> 00:06:25.385 align:start size:94% position:6%
is that we're losing so
many people like yourself.

00:06:25.385 --> 00:06:26.886
So people are essentially voting

00:06:26.886 --> 00:06:28.488
with their feet,
they're leaving,

00:06:28.488 --> 00:06:30.189
So it's making it
harder and harder.

00:06:30.189 --> 00:06:33.793 align:start size:97% position:3%
So we've got major, you wanna
talk about "2000 Mules,"

00:06:33.793 --> 00:06:37.363
I mean, "2000 Mules"
is legal in California.

00:06:37.363 --> 00:06:41.234
And so how they've
really destroyed it
is they essentially,

00:06:41.234 --> 00:06:46.239 align:start size:94% position:6%
now it's mandatory voting,
mandatory registration.

00:06:47.407 --> 00:06:48.908
So if you go to the
DMV for anything,

00:06:48.908 --> 00:06:50.243
you get registered to vote.

00:06:50.243 --> 00:06:52.845
And in fact, I think
it's totally chaotic.

00:06:52.845 --> 00:06:54.781 align:start size:88% position:13%
We don't know who the
hell's registered there.

00:06:54.781 --> 00:06:56.883
Some people get
multiple ballots,

00:06:56.883 --> 00:07:00.586 align:start size:97% position:3%
and they made legal what was
done in the last election

00:07:00.586 --> 00:07:02.422 align:start size:84% position:16%
