00:34:28.633 --> 00:34:30.568
President Trump felt like
we could work with 'em,

00:34:30.568 --> 00:34:32.637
and that's why we
chose Apple first,

00:34:32.637 --> 00:34:33.638
'cause we had to.

00:34:35.139 --> 00:34:36.641 align:start size:84% position:16%
If you're not on
the Apple App Store,

00:34:36.641 --> 00:34:38.109
and you're not in the
