00:34:38.109 --> 00:34:40.344
it's just tough to
ultimately compete

00:34:40.344 --> 00:34:43.214
against Instagram and TikTok.

00:34:43.214 --> 00:34:46.818
So now the good thing
is that we're trying

00:34:46.818 --> 00:34:50.555 align:start size:84% position:16%
to be a family
friendly place to be.

00:34:50.555 --> 00:34:54.292 align:start size:94% position:6%
So we're not looking to
have any illegal activity.

00:34:54.292 --> 00:34:56.461 align:start size:81% position:19%
We don't want like
porn on there,

00:34:57.628 --> 00:34:59.263
and some vulgarity is okay,

00:34:59.263 --> 00:35:00.865
but you can't get
crazy about it.

00:35:00.865 --> 00:35:03.134
So we really wanna
be family friendly.

00:35:03.134 --> 00:35:06.838
And that right now is, so far,

00:35:06.838 --> 00:35:09.340
we've had a great working
relationship with Apple.

00:35:10.508 --> 00:35:14.145
Google, we waited kind
of for that to be last.

00:35:14.145 --> 00:35:17.715
I mean, 'cause now we're up
on the web, truthsocial.com.

00:35:17.715 --> 00:35:18.983
Anybody can get onto it.

00:35:18.983 --> 00:35:21.219
Even if Apple was
to get rid of us,

00:35:21.219 --> 00:35:22.920 align:start size:81% position:19%
you could still
have your account.

00:35:24.122 --> 00:35:25.423
And Google's just
more problematic.

00:35:25.423 --> 00:35:27.058
We already talked about
some of those issues,

00:35:27.058 --> 00:35:28.459
but we're working with them.

00:35:31.596 --> 00:35:33.264 align:start size:81% position:19%
At this time, I
can't say anything

00:35:33.264 --> 00:35:36.033
that they're trying to keep
us off the Google Play Store.

00:35:36.033 --> 00:35:37.502
But look, once again,,

00:35:37.502 --> 00:35:38.803
we have a little
bit of an advantage

00:35:38.803 --> 00:35:41.172 align:start size:84% position:16%
that we're not
