00:35:47.545 --> 00:35:49.280
I think that's gonna
make it really tough

00:35:49.280 --> 00:35:52.183
for them to kick us
off their stores.

00:35:52.183 --> 00:35:53.484
Plus they already know, look,

00:35:53.484 --> 00:35:55.720
they're not stupid here, Dave.

00:35:55.720 --> 00:35:58.489
Republicans are likely
gonna smash the left

00:35:58.489 --> 00:36:00.158
in the elections.

00:36:00.158 --> 00:36:03.694
You see big tech running ads
constantly all over the place

00:36:03.694 --> 00:36:05.129
